 {
  "key": "s1638a",
  "en": "Most fine, master! But 'tis not enough. I will do a great service, and are not great services bought at great price?",
  "uses": [
   "table"
  ],
  "zil": "2actions.zil:3356"
 },
 {
  "key": "s163d2",
  "en": "Very nice, but not enough!",
  "uses": [
   "table"
  ],
  "zil": "2actions.zil:3358"
 },
 {
  "key": "s163e2",
  "en": "Ah, truly magnificent! Keep them coming.",
